      "value": "I forget exactly what I said the last time I saw this suggestion, but basically I want to opt out of this. \n\nI do not want to see what a troll is going to show only certain people. Just give me the robot or block them, either is fine. \n\nI guess its a good idea I just suspect that any use of it that I come across will be abusive.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
